AU  - Zhou, Leijing
AU  - Guan, Xiaotong
AU  - Liu, Peigen
T3  - CSCW Companion '25
AB  - The proliferation of fake news on social media presents a significant societal challenge, particularly for vulnerable populations such as older adults. This paper introduces TrueAI, an AI-enhanced intervention founded on Technocognition. TrueAI integrates cognitive principles, intervening at the critical moment that older adults attempt to forward potential fake news. By presenting real-time fake news alerts and comparisons with verified information from authoritative sources, TrueAI facilitates informed decision-making. Preliminary experiments (N=15) showed that TrueAI significantly reduced participants’ forwarding of fake news. As a user-centric intervention leveraging AI, TrueAI offers the CSCW community valuable insights into designing socio-technical solutions to mitigate the negative impacts of fake news on vulnerable groups.
