TI  - What do professional software developers need to know to succeed in an age of Artificial Intelligence?
AU  - Kam, Matthew
AU  - Miller, Cody
AU  - Wang, Miaoxin
AU  - Tidwell, Abey
AU  - Lee, Irene A.
AU  - Malyn-Smith, Joyce
AU  - Perret, Beatriz
