AB  - With the introduction of information technology, the level of informatization and automation in the catering industry has been continuously improved. Its text information processing technology has gradually become a new research hotspot in publicity and promotion in the catering industry. However, because there are many high-frequency words in the catering industry, and the text includes a large amount of unstructured free text and image and image information, it is more difficult for computers to process, resulting in information technology cannot be effectively used by computers. This paper uses machine learning and natural language processing related technologies to analyze and mine the text content in the catering industry, overcome the traditional text classification that requires a series of preprocessing and feature engineering modeling methods, and finally generate valuable information and The knowledge content provides relevant personnel with auxiliary decision-making needs, and at the same time, it has reference significance for the effective use of unstructured data of promotional text content in the catering industry.
