AB  - Because of the convenience of the social platform, the spread of the rumors has become more and more serious. Rumors will not only propagate misinformation but may also affect people's normal lives and even cause panic among the people. Many researchers have explored the machine learning techniques to detect the rumors automatically. In this survey, we will discuss these machine learning models from four perspectives: (1) the datasets used in training and verifying the models, (2) the features to detect the rumors, (3) the algorithms of rumor detection, (4) the metrics used to evaluate the results of the models. After reviewing the past work of rumor detection models, we highlight some rumor detection development directions at the end of the survey.
