AB  - Integrating curriculum ideology and politics into the whole process of education and teaching is an effective way to realize the whole process of educating people in colleges and universities. We take the database management system in the university ideological and political education courses as an example, and carry out teaching reforms in response to the current mismatch in class hours, the strange phenomenon of learning style in the multimedia classroom, and the emphasis on skills over moral education in the current teaching of this course. Finally, the article integrates computer artificial intelligence technology on the basis of teaching reform, designs and develops a computer-assisted teaching system for ideological and political education based on a hybrid P2P network. The system includes functions such as discussion group, electronic whiteboard, courseware management, homework management, online examination subsystem, and teaching video-on-demand subsystem. This paper describes in detail the important links in the system development process, such as demand analysis, design and implementation, and testing. Finally, the auxiliary teaching system developed in this thesis has been successfully deployed in colleges and universities, and the operation effect is good.
