TI  - Automatic Resource Augmentation for Machine Translation in Low Resource Language: EnIndic Corpus
AU  - Banerjee, Anasua
AU  - Kumar, Vinay
AU  - Shankar, Achyut
AU  - Jhaveri, Rutvij H.
AU  - Banik, Debajyoty
