AB  - With the in-depth development of a new round of global scientific and technological revolution and industrial revolution, the accelerated evolution of digital technology represented by artificial intelligence has made everyone's imagination of artificial intelligence and future technology have a concrete carrier, and has formed a trend of universal dependence. Combined with the research on the algorithm of personalized news recommendation system, this paper analyzes the crisis risk caused by AIGC in the news industry from the perspective of human-machine relationship, adopts literature review and evidence-based systematic evaluation from the interdisciplinary perspective, and guides individuals to look at AIGC from the perspective of news ethics. At the same time, the corresponding solution is proposed, and the governance framework of journalism in the era of artificial intelligence is constantly improved. While AIGC promotes the intelligent upgrading of the news industry, it clarifies the dual impact of technology, establishes the awareness of crisis, and takes preventive measures.
