AB  - This paper focuses on the research of the integration of large models and digital humans, aiming to explore new directions of artificial intelligence technology. As an important component of deep learning, large models have powerful data processing and learning capabilities Power, while digital humans are virtual humans built on artificial intelligence technology, with rich interactivity and realism. By integrating large models with digital humans, it is possible to enhance the intelligence of digital humans and broaden their application areas. The paper explores the emerging field of integrating large models and digital humans, analyzes their technical characteristics and feasibility of integration. Large models have the advantages of deep learning and data processing, while digital humans are widely popular for their realistic interactivity. The study reveals the enormous potential of fusion applications in virtual interaction, intelligent services, education and training, and proposes strategies to address technical and ethical issues. This study provides a new perspective for the development of artificial intelligence, which is expected to promote the progress and application of related technologies.
